      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63945c1874ca0f2308791745",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（还要……完成压倒性的，进化――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46e74a2e0c96cc3bf4a8a41012376d7798e878cc35b7077b38f9357aada88e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c30647f5412a84d8affd2347",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记者会结束的同时，我关掉电视。\n刹那间，令人刺痛的寂静降临……\n仿佛反衬着方才记者会的盛况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03492167b52e64e021d586c3c65fb1d4c71540802836e18249bf32812b5fd42a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d692a9afb47e68996a662e6f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她……到了秋天，究竟会成长到何种地步……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ca1e6015d18abf08e767bac1e5cd1ef8f33f8b57580739edceb23bff914771",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446ed989f0ae78d5e953fa1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的话语，无比坚定。\n充满了确信。\n正因如此――我忽然，感到脊背发凉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e85ac937e59c37ee8ee1b8c2ee406c883c0a130a8a9c3f63b6e51ddf76ba8217",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
